{"case_id": "r1pdf:ecd1a395eb5f25610750d721", "input_sha256": "3e296eb76f8b4d780998899bd6f1460c0a38cfd991d5ac493f5414fa31d61d41", "raw_output": "```json\n{\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"D01:S02\",\n    \"D01:S04\",\n    \"D01:S08\"\n  ],\n  \"quotes\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S02\",\n      \"quote\": \"2.2.1 Sliding Window quality filtering\\nThe Sliding Window uses\\na relatively standard approach. This works by scanning from the\\n5′ end of the read, and removes the 3′ end of the read when the\\naverage quality of a group of bases drops below a specified\\nthreshold.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S04\",\n      \"quote\": \"Note: Both quality modes are shown for Trimmomatic. Best values are indicated in\\nbold. MI indicates Maximum Information mode, and SW indicates Sliding Window\\nmode.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S08\",\n      \"quote\": \"Trimmomatic uses a pipeline-based architecture, allowing indi-\\nvidual ‘steps’ (adapter removal, quality filtering, etc.) to be\\napplied\\nto\\neach\\nread/read\\npair,\\nin\\nthe\\norder\\nspecified\\nby the user.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"证据支持Trimmomatic能够执行质量修剪（quality filtering），且Sliding Window（SW）是其质量修剪模式之一（D01:S04, D01:S08）。D01:S02提供了Sliding Window算法的具体机制（扫描5'端，当平均质量低于阈值时移除3'端），支持目标引用中关于“使用滑动窗口切割等算法进行质量修剪”的主张。证据未直接提及“popular”（流行）这一属性，也未直接证明其是“adapter tool”（尽管D01:S08提到adapter removal步骤，但目标引用主要强调其作为修剪工具执行质量修剪的能力，且D01:S04明确将其与质量模式关联）。\"\n}\n```", "attempted": true, "observed_input": {"input_tokens": 1056, "required_total": 1568, "input_ids_sha256": "62a09e038105708c69d4afcbc674f7bfe532f639eecb721b75ac75e7ed553634", "within_budget": true, "truncation": false, "generated_token_ids": [71093, 2164, 198, 90, 198, 220, 328, 68, 26590, 7824, 763, 498, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 17, 487, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 19, 487, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 23, 1, 198, 220, 10339, 198, 220, 328, 51492, 763, 498, 198, 262, 313, 198, 406, 328, 68, 265