{"case_id": "r1pdf:e1636ac35ca5131bfdf6fb44", "input_sha256": "2bf9ef6b5021d9b9808e62c8a8c294c6c7b9820efbc2208d2b89de2e617b0b23", "raw_output": "```json\n{\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"D01:S01\",\n    \"D01:S02\",\n    \"D01:S05\",\n    \"D01:S08\"\n  ],\n  \"quotes\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S01\",\n      \"quote\": \"In summary, we developed a tool called AfterQC with\\nrich quality control, data filtering, error profiling and cor-\\nrection functions for next generation sequencing data.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S02\",\n      \"quote\": \"We will present AfterQC in this paper, a tool developed\\nto address major practical sequencing data quality con-\\ntrol and filtering problems.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S05\",\n      \"quote\": \"AfterQC can be viewed as a mix of quality control tools\\n(i.e. FastQC) and data filtering/trimming tools (i.e. Trim-\\nmomatic, cutadapt).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S08\",\n      \"quote\": \"AfterQC is able to perform quality control,\\ndata filtering, error profiling and base correction automatically.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"证据支持目标引用中关于AfterQC整合质量控制（quality control）、数据过滤（data filtering）和修剪（trimming）功能的描述。D01:S01和D01:S08明确列出了质量控制、数据过滤、错误分析和校正功能；D01:S05指出其结合了质量控制和修剪工具的特性。然而，候选证据中未明确提及“adapter trimming”（接头修剪）这一具体功能，尽管D01:S08提到“detect and cut adapters”，但目标引用将其概括为“adapter trimming”，且证据未直接支持“integrate... into one tool”这一特定表述，仅支持其具备这些功能。因此，证据部分支持了功能整合的主张，但对“adapter trimming”的具体表述支持有限。\"\n}\n```", "attempted": true, "observed_input": {"input_tokens": 1875, "required_total": 2387, "input_ids_sha256": "27ff99cc1a4f43494253ae8b47c3ad9befe3dd421b0a8f8086291d1b323c2fdf", "within_budget": true, "truncation": false, "generated_token_ids": [71093, 2164, 198, 90, 198, 220, 328, 68, 26590, 7824, 763, 498, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 16, 487, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 17, 487, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 20, 487, 198, 262, 328, 35, 1